      "role": "user",
      "content": "I've been seeing a lot of scary stuff on the news about interest rates lately and it's making me really nervous. Can you give me an honest outlook on how stable my portfolio is gonna be for the next six months? I'm thinking about just moving everything to a savings account where it's safe. What do you think?",
